  "details": "The ability to fully customize keybinds on Quest would be awesome. My controller has unfixable very severe drift, and I can't afford to buy a new one, and I can't play VRChat because the drift is so bad. the ability to customize controls so I can bind movement to the other controller would be awesome. in addition to fixing my issue, it's also just a very good feature for accessibility in general. for a game where a huge feature is being able to fully customize almost everything, this seems like a no brainer. and while i don't know for sure, in my experience with game development this would be pretty easy to implement.",
